2
00:00:02.394 --> 00:00:32.319
Namaste! Aaj ka lesson hai Food chains connect life. Food chain dikhati hai ki energy ek living thing se doosri tak kaise jaati hai. Is baat ko dheere-dheere samjhenge, phir ek aasaan example dekhenge. Learning mein galti hona bilkul normal hai; hum har step ko dobara check kar sakte hain.

3
00:00:32.319 --> 00:01:02.244
Grass ko grasshopper, grasshopper ko frog, aur frog ko snake kha sakta hai. Dhyaan do ki example mein kaunsi cheez badal rahi hai aur kaunsi same rehti hai. Pehle apna andaaza bolo, phir reason dhoondo. Agar tum kisi dost ko samjha sakte ho, to concept aur mazboot ho jaata hai.

4
00:01:02.244 --> 00:01:36.958
Local plants aur animals ke examples se ek simple chain banao; arrows energy ki direction dikhayen. Apne observation ko ek sentence mein likho. Har number ya label ke saath sahi unit ya naam lagao. Sawaal solve karte waqt jaldi mat karo; clue ko underline karo, apna tareeka chuno, aur aakhir mein jawab ko example ke saath compare karo.

